as"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Le chemin sera difficile, mais jamais trop long"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Si on y met tout notre c\u0153ur, nos r\u00eaves seront plus forts"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}